            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the notes below. Write <strong>ONE WORD ONLY</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div class=\"notes-title\"><strong>Recycling Tyres in Australia</strong></div><p class=\"sub-head\">Background</p><ul><li>More than 1.5 million tyres dumped in Australia per {{31}}</li></ul><p>Previous recycling attempts failed because:</p><ul><li>there were pollution problems — smoke from burning</li><li>recycling companies didn't make any {{32}}</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Advantages of Molectra's process</p><ul><li>More economical because smaller machines are used</li><li>Less maintenance — tyres softened before shredding</li><li>No limit on the {{33}} of tyres recycled</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">The Future</p><ul><li>Ten more factories being built</li><li>Plans to spend 5% of income each year on {{34}}</li></ul></div>",
