            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the flow-chart below. Write <strong>ONE WORD ONLY</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div class=\"notes-title\"><strong>Recycling Tyres</strong></div><div><p class=\"sub-head\">Process</p><p class=\"sub-head\">Possible Uses</p><div>Removal of steel {{35}} from tyre rim</div><div>Steel pellets used in industry</div><div>↓</div><div></div><div>Chemicals applied to get rid of {{36}} and soften rubber</div><div></div><div>↓</div><div></div><div>Fibres, e.g. nylon, removed</div><div>• Strengthening concrete<br>• Sheets made of {{37}}</div><div>↓</div><div></div><div>Tyres cut up into crumb rubber</div><div>• Asphalt for roads<br>• Insulation<br>• {{38}} tiles</div><div>↓</div><div></div><div>The MolectraVac machine microwaves rubber into hydrocarbon</div><div> i) Used for activated carbon<br> • {{39}} treatment<br> • air filtration<br> ii) Used for carbon black<br> • batteries<br> • {{40}}<br> iii) Oil used for electricity </div></div></div>",
